do CutsceneManager.disable_player_functionality()
join TowerGuide right [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
TowerGuide: Congratulations on completing the Hunter Exam and acquiring your Hunter License!
TowerGuide: If the controls don't suit your taste, remember that you can change them in control settings (by hitting 'ESC' key) - Also, soon, full controller support will be implemented.
TowerGuide: Good luck, and may your bounty be plentiful!
[wait time="2.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do CutsceneManager.to_first_floor()